<article class="env-lemma" id="09KR">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09KR">Lemma <span data-tag="09KR">22.21.1</span>.</a> Let $(A, \text{d})$ be a differential graded algebra. Let $I$ be a differential graded $A$-module. If $F_\bullet $ is a filtration as in property (I), then we obtain an admissible short exact sequence </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  0 \to I \to \prod \nolimits I/F_ iI \to \prod \nolimits I/F_ iI \to 0  \]
</div>
  <p> of differential graded $A$-modules. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
